      "description": "running_total / cap_usd per role, joined from budget_counters and budget_policies (v1 scope: user_id and provider NULL). budget_policies has no live write path before FRE-1209's sync (service startup) -- until that sync runs, this panel shows No data by architecture, not staleness. Thresholds at .75 / .9 of cap.",
