      },
      "description": "route_traces.cost_live_usd vs cost_authoritative_usd, every trace in the window. Deliberately NOT filtered to cost_reconciled=true: that flag means abs(live-authoritative)<=tolerance (route_trace/assembler.py), so filtering on it would hide exactly the divergent rows this panel exists to surface. divergence=0 on a reconciled trace; non-zero where the live estimate and the ledger disagree. All trace_id values here are native Postgres UUIDs -- the dashed-vs-hex split (FRE-1186) is an ES<->PG issue and does not apply to this single-substrate query.",
